  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n ({frac{1)/(4) div (1)/(2)times( {(2)/(5) - (1)/(3)} )}}{{1(2)/(3) of (3)/(4) - (1)/(4) of (2)/(3)}}\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n ({frac{1)/(4) div (1)/(2)times( {(2)/(5) - (1)/(3)} )}}{{1(2)/(3) of (3)/(4) - (1)/(4) of (2)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(4) div (1)/(2)times( {(2)/(5) - (1)/(3)} )}}{{1(2)/(3) of (3)/(4) - (1)/(4) of (2)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(4) div (1)/(2)times(1)/(15)}}{{1(2)/(3) of (3)/(4) - (1)/(4) of (2)/(3)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(4) div (1)/(2)times(1)/(15)}}{{(5)/(4) - (1)/(6)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(4) times 2 times (1)/(15)}}{{(5)/(4) - (1)/(6)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(30)}}{{(5)/(4) - (1)/(6)}}\n\n⇒ ({frac{1)/(30)}}{{(13)/(12)}}\n\n⇒ {(12)/(30 times 13)}\n\n⇒ 2/65\n\n**∴ The required answer is 2/65**",
